    <string name="regular_short">Regular</string>
    <string name="privacy_local_data">Regular bookmarks, browsing history and preferences are stored locally on this device. HISN does not operate a browsing-history server and does not intentionally upload browsing history, bookmarks or typed search terms to the developer. WebView manages website cookies, cache and storage as websites use them.</string>
    <string name="privacy_private">Private browsing uses a separate Android process and WebView data directory. HISN asks WebView to remove session cookies, website storage and cache when the private activity ends. Downloads you explicitly start remain in the public Downloads folder. Private mode does not hide activity from websites, network administrators or your internet provider.</string>
    <string name="privacy_connections">HTTPS certificate errors are not bypassed. HTTP pages are supported but are not encrypted. The built-in tracker blocker uses a small local domain list and cannot block every ad or tracker. Websites may still receive the requests needed to deliver pages you visit.</string>
    <string name="privacy_permissions">Website camera and microphone requests are denied by default in this version. Supported file upload selectors are forwarded to Android’s file picker.</string>
    <string name="privacy_controls">You can delete individual bookmarks and history entries, clear regular history, and clear cached WebView content in Settings. Clearing cache does not clear cookies or saved website logins.</string>
